cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "dataexcept: Structured, Classed Failures that Cross Language Boundaries"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An R package of classed error conditions for data and modelling code that
  carry structured fields and machine-readable recovery metadata, and that
  serialise to the language-neutral failure envelope published by the Python
  DataExcept package, so failures from R and Python share one format.
